    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b7d8bd33591c27be28879b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Aug 2024 21:16:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好 我是韩大狗</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听我的播客节目《高脚凳对谈》，这是一档和脱口秀演员聊聊他专场背后的栏目</span></p><span></span><p><span>专场名字的由来、巡演故事、想在专场传递的内核、编排专场内容的逻辑、调试专场的技巧......任何关于专场的内容，不限于以上这些，都有可能在这个节目里听到</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：王梓晗@脱缰小象</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>梓晗老师是圈内非常资深的演员和脱口秀培训讲师，之前也有幸在笑果训练营上过她的课。她也出版了我个人很推荐的脱口秀创作工具书《</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36110222/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36110222/"><span>单口喜剧进阶指南</span></a><span>》。这期节目里和梓晗老师聊了《她是你我》到《我呀？！》转变的过程以及一些创作想法，也交流了一些当下脱口秀演员会有的困惑，可谓非常非常“干”，但也是我觉得可能会常听常新的一期节目。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Shownotes：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="229">03:49</a> 《她是你我》的结束到《我呀？！》的诞生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="672">11:12</a> 而《她是你我》双拼专场的诞生有点偶然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1195">19:55</a> 首演上台之前还在修改内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 每一场都会实体化地想象出她就坐在台下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1989">33:09</a> 为了更广泛的受众，但又不是为了扩大受众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 寻找更多的简单真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2560">42:40</a> 怎么串联简单真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3160">52:40</a> 观众可能没有我们想得那么“简单”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3460">57:40</a> 专场创作思维 VS 拼盘内容创作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3830">63:50</a> 有时候其实我们不需要开放麦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">69:00</a> 不使用开放麦的时候，试试这个工具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4305">71:45</a> 自我表达专场？段子合集专场？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4695">78:15</a> 创作背后也是各有得失自我取舍的过程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5378">89:38</a> 王梓晗比较喜欢的演员和专场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6224">103:44</a> 开场段子真的只能靠外化标签吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6420">107:00</a> 结构里用了个不太一样的Callback</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6678">111:18</a> 专场里如何更好地整合各个段子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7120">118:40</a> 观众朋友们，忠于自己的判断！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期播客提到的国外单口喜剧演员：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>James Acaster, Neal Brennan, Taylor Tomlinson</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>Starry 9 —— $uicideboy$</span></p><span></span><p><span>她和她和她 —— 于贞</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>策划：韩大狗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>剪辑：韩大狗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>播客封面：韩大狗</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrRNZvm6NnySEhK7RY4rL-cfmW7P.m4a" length="121383306" type="audio/mp4"/>
